            "content": "<p>Federal car seat regulations have been updated, with required manufacture dates between June 2025 and December 2026. To meet the updated regulations, some car seat models may have updated their minimum or maximum weight, height or age requirements. Other products may have updated headrests or side wing areas.</p>"
